  "serverOnlyNote": "Empty. Option-membership used to live here because form-core had no such rule and the UI was treated as the constraint — which meant a tampered or imported payload could put any value into a choice field and only the server would object. form-core now implements `option` with these exact semantics, so the cases are SHARED and both implementations are held to them.",
  "serverOnlyCases": []
}
